Question: The cognitive psychologist's conclusion follows logically if which one of the following is assumed?
A. Most skilled artists are good at abstract reasoning.
B. Most skilled artists are famous.
C. All people who are good at abstract reasoning are very creative.
D. Some skilled artists are not famous.
